            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Category and Ordered",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`s.astype('category')` stores ==codes== plus one list of categories",
                "`.cat.categories` and `.cat.codes` show the two parts",
                "`memory_usage(deep=True)` shows the saving; best for {green:low cardinality}",
                "`pd.CategoricalDtype([...], ordered=True)` or `s.cat.as_ordered()`",
                "Ordered: compare, `min`, `max` and sort in ==logical order=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "lvl = pd.CategoricalDtype(['low','mid','high'], ordered=True)",
                "s = s.astype(lvl)",
                "s[s >= 'mid']"
              ],
              "note": "list order is the value order"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. cut and qcut",
